  "type": "tab",
  "label": "ML Control",
  "disabled": false,
  "info": "Buttons for the ml mapper on Hub Core (wired through the link nodes).\n\n  1. Put the inputs in a state (Dummy Devices: freeze tv m = 0.1) and set the target (Hub Core: cassette m = 0.9).\n  2. record  -> one training pair (current inputs -> current outputs)\n  3. repeat for a few states, then train, then predict on.\n  4. Dummy Devices: resume sine. The cassette follows the learned curve."
